<title>USA: Video Update offering 6.1 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Video Update offering 6.1 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Video Update Inc said Friday it is offering publicly 6.1 million shares of class A common stock at $4.00 a share.</p>
<p>Net proceeds from the offering will be used to provide working capital, make acquisitions, reduce outstanding debt, open additional stores and meet other general corporate purposes, it added.  </p>
<p>Piper Jaffray Inc and Robinson-Humphrey Co Inc are serving as underwriters on this transaction.</p>
<p>Video Update owns, operates and franchises video specialty stores in the United States and Canada.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
